        "title": "Asei kandih man nipui nung",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Asei kandih man ni puinung,",
            "Kum the aniu tammei hei;",
            "Raguang rui suaihiam ntangmei –",
            "Tilou o nban thai khang.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Ntam puni the asei hei,",
            "Chunsi jangsi rui padik ge;",
            "Raguang rui nduanglou kandiu,",
            "Aniu guai tam kansini.",
            "",
            "2. Aniu hei ntam kansini,",
            "Jailou o nang jaujian rui;",
            "Ganglou makmei laujiu na kum,",
            "Patlou ri o aniu guai ta.",
            "",
            "3. Jianmei nun ta ntam lana,",
            "Chunsi jangsi rui padik;",
            "Ntamloumei chunsi mikdui,",
            "He Raguuang thut phui lou o.",
            "",
            "4. Raguang rui jaujianmei lung khou,",
            "Neilana bam cham datni;",
            "Tingkauh kandih guangtang pukhou,",
            "Sulak khe chunsi salam."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
